{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>厭倦了千篇一律的鬧鐘鈴聲？《VoiceWake》讓你在 App 內直接錄下真人聲音，再把這段錄音設為鬧鐘；你可以用孩子的摯友聲音叫醒孩子，也可以讓重要的人陪你展開一天。軟件原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，適合想擺脫冰冷提示音、重視私隱及不希望被廣告打擾的 iOS 用戶。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-54.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>錄製專屬語音鬧鐘</h2>\n<p>在 App 內即可完成錄音，無需匯入檔案；你還可以建立一個小小的語音庫，日後重複選用。設定時間、挑選重複日子、再選一把聲音，鬧鐘便會以該段錄音響起來。即使手機處於靜音或專注模式，鬧鐘依然會響，避免睡過頭。使用過程無需帳戶，亦沒有廣告，所有錄音只保留在你的裝置上。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-105-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-106-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-107-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-108-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：VoiceWake</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/voicewake/id6780061570?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:28.126696+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T20:37:41+00:00"